page('about','About Ed’s Plumbing and Sewer Inc. | Darien & Chicago','Meet Ed’s Plumbing and Sewer Inc., based in Darien and serving Chicago and its suburbs with plumbing, sewer, home repair, and remodeling services.',intro('ABOUT ED’S','Pride in the work.<br>Respect for your home.','A local plumbing and sewer company with a simple purpose: helping Chicagoland homeowners take care of the places they call home.')+f'<section class="section wrap detail-grid"><div><h2>Chicagoland is home.</h2><p>Ed’s Plumbing and Sewer Inc. is based in Darien, Illinois, and serves Chicago and the surrounding suburbs. Plumbing and sewer work are at the heart of what we do, with home repairs and remodeling available through the same phone number.</p><h3>One call, from repair to renovation.</h3><p>Reach out for a clogged drain, a new fixture, a water heater replacement, or a home project you are ready to start. We’ll discuss your needs and the next step for your property.</p><h3>Red, white, blue—and ready to help.</h3><p>The American flag has long been part of Ed’s website. It remains part of our look today, reflecting the owner’s patriotic spirit and pride in serving local homes.</p><a class="text-link" href="/services/">Find the service you need →</a></div><aside><p class="eyebrow">ED’S PLUMBING & SEWER INC.</p><h2>Let’s get<br>to work.</h2><p>17W431 North Frontage Road<br>Darien, IL 60561</p>{btn()}</aside></section>')
page('service-area','Chicago & Suburban Plumbing Service Area | Ed’s','Ed’s serves Chicago and the Chicago suburbs from Darien, Illinois. Call (630) 663-1444 with your town or ZIP code to arrange plumbing or sewer service.',intro('OUR SERVICE AREA','At home in Chicagoland.','From Chicago neighborhoods to the surrounding suburbs, call Ed’s for plumbing, sewer service, and home projects. Our home base is Darien, Illinois.')+'''<section class="section wrap detail-grid"><div><h2>Chicago and the surrounding suburbs</h2><p>We serve the Chicago area, including western, southwestern, northern, and southern suburbs. Call with your address and project details to confirm appointment availability.</p><h3>Close to our Darien home base</h3><p>Darien, Downers Grove, Woodridge, Westmont, Hinsdale, Willowbrook, Burr Ridge, Lisle, and Oak Brook are among the communities around our home base.</p><h3>Across the wider Chicago area</h3><p>Looking for help in Chicago, Naperville, Bolingbrook, Elmhurst, Wheaton, Lombard, Oak Park, Schaumburg, Evanston, or Orland Park? Call to discuss your location and the work you need.</p><h3>The right information makes scheduling easier.</h3><p>Have your town or ZIP code ready, tell us whether the problem affects one fixture or several, and let us know if you need urgent help. For planned projects, share your preferred timing.</p><a class="text-link" href="/services/">Explore plumbing and home services →</a></div><aside><p class="eyebrow">YOUR LOCAL POINT OF CONTACT</p><h2>One number.<br>All of Chicagoland.</h2><p>Call to confirm service and scheduling for your address.</p>'''+btn()+'</aside></section>')
page('contact-us','Contact Ed’s Plumbing and Sewer Inc. | (630) 663-1444','Call Ed’s at (630) 663-1444 for plumbing and sewer service in Chicago and its suburbs. Darien office: Mon–Fri, 9 am–5 pm. Emergency service available.',intro('CONTACT ED’S','A real conversation.<br>A clear next step.','Tell us what is happening at your home or what you are planning. Call to discuss the work and arrange service.')+f'<section class="section wrap contact-grid"><div class="contact-primary"><p class="eyebrow">GIVE ED’S A CALL</p><a class="big-phone" href="tel:+16306631444">(630) 663-1444 ↗</a><p>24-hour emergency service available.<br>For urgent service, please contact us by phone.</p><hr><h2>Before you call</h2><ul><li>Your town or ZIP code</li><li>A brief description of the problem or project</li><li>When the issue started and which fixtures are affected</li><li>Your preferred appointment timing</li></ul></div><div class="contact-info"><h2>Based in Darien</h2><address>Ed’s Plumbing and Sewer Inc.<br>17W431 North Frontage Road<br>Darien, IL 60561</address><a class="text-link" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=17W431+North+Frontage+Road+Darien+IL+60561">Get directions ↗</a><h3>Regular office hours</h3><p>Monday–Friday <strong>9 am–5 pm</strong><br>Saturday–Sunday <strong>Closed</strong></p><p class="small">Emergency service is available outside regular office hours. Call to confirm availability.</p></div></section>')
